{"id": "1827930", "name": "מיון נקודות אי־רציפות – פונקציה מקוטעת מורכבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: none; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q6_VISUAL_V7\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">מיון נקודות אי־רציפות – פונקציה מקוטעת מורכבת</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 12px;\">נתונה הפונקציה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; overflow-x: visible;\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)=\\begin{cases}\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}} &amp; x\\leq {{CT:2}}\\\\\\frac{{{CT:3}}}{\\left({{CT:4}}\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{{{CT:5}}}-3\\right)} &amp; x&gt;{{CT:2}}\\end{cases}\\)</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">שימו לב לתחום ההגדרה המשתמע מן הנוסחה.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<p>מצאו את \\(\\displaystyle S_1\\), \\(\\displaystyle S_2\\), \\(\\displaystyle S_3\\): קבוצות נקודות האי־רציפות הסליקות, הקפיצות והאי־רציפויות העיקריות, בהתאמה.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">הקבוצות</div>\n<p>הזינו כל קבוצה באמצעות סוגריים מסולסלים. לקבוצה הריקה הזינו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\{\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\\(\\displaystyle S_1\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\\(\\displaystyle S_2\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border: 1px solid #EEECEF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\\(\\displaystyle S_3\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">[[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q6_CONTINUITY_V4_CASES_LIMITINLINE\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<p>מנתחים את הנקודות המיוחדות של שני הענפים.</p>\n<p>בענף הראשון הגורם \\(\\displaystyle x+{{CT:6}}\\) מצטמצם, ולכן \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:7}}\\) היא נקודת אי־רציפות סליקה. בנקודה \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:8}}\\) משתנה הסימן של הגורם \\(\\displaystyle {{CT:9}}\\), ולכן מתקבלת קפיצה.</p>\n<p>בנקודת החיבור \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:2}}\\) משווים את הגבולות החד־צדדיים. הערכים הם \\(\\displaystyle {{CT:10}}\\) ו־\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:11}}\\); אם הם שונים, גם נקודה זו שייכת לקבוצת הקפיצות.</p>\n<p>בענף השני הנקודה \\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:12}}\\) יוצרת אי־רציפות עיקרית.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto;\">\\(\\displaystyle S_1={{CT:13}}\\;,\\;S_2={{CT:14}}\\;,\\;S_3={{CT:15}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "S1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.333333, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "S2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.333333, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "S3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.333334, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["S1", "S2", "S3", "a", "b", "c", "d", "fs", "gs", "i1", "i2", "s"], "nvariants": 50}